    "detailed_description": "<i><strong>[h2Escape from the Ant Kingdom full of ants![/h2]</strong></i><br>You are a fragrant and delicious jelly in an ant's den, and you are currently wanted.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075170/extras/3ff285250e507ca5214c0c692576138e.avif?t=1671629779\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The goal is to survive somehow.<br>Survive and escape.</h2><br><br><strong><u><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>It's a must to apply soil to hide the smell!</li></ul></u></strong><br>Let's shovel the soil piled up all over the map and use it.<br>If you run out of dirt gauges and get caught... there will be a big trouble.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><u><strong>Various endings that change with a small choice</strong></u></li></ul>Let's collect more than 20 endings.<br>Let's make the ending collection rate 100%.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><u><strong>There is not one way out</strong></u></li></ul>Ant Kingdom is wider than you think and there are many places to go.<br>Maybe getting out isn't the only answer...<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><u><strong>Unique items</strong></u></li></ul>Collect items and use them wisely<br><u>Let's find ingenious ways to use it!</u>",
    "about_the_game": "<i><strong>[h2Escape from the Ant Kingdom full of ants![/h2]</strong></i><br>You are a fragrant and delicious jelly in an ant's den, and you are currently wanted.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075170/extras/3ff285250e507ca5214c0c692576138e.avif?t=1671629779\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The goal is to survive somehow.<br>Survive and escape.</h2><br><br><strong><u><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>It's a must to apply soil to hide the smell!</li></ul></u></strong><br>Let's shovel the soil piled up all over the map and use it.<br>If you run out of dirt gauges and get caught... there will be a big trouble.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><u><strong>Various endings that change with a small choice</strong></u></li></ul>Let's collect more than 20 endings.<br>Let's make the ending collection rate 100%.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><u><strong>There is not one way out</strong></u></li></ul>Ant Kingdom is wider than you think and there are many places to go.<br>Maybe getting out isn't the only answer...<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><u><strong>Unique items</strong></u></li></ul>Collect items and use them wisely<br><u>Let's find ingenious ways to use it!</u>",
